    v3_pkg: "v3 package\nSingle package, 60 source files.\nDelta A (optional): consider splitting pkg/cmdguard/v3 into\n  v3 (public API) + v3/internal/flag system + v3/internal/di\nIF the single package grows past ~12k LOC. Currently 8.2k — no action."
